    Wire in existing en-GB and zh-TW locale files (#7766)
    
    lang-en_GB.json and lang-zh_TW.json existed under src/i18n/ but were
    never imported or registered with i18next, so those locales were
    unreachable and always fell back to en/zh. Register them as en-GB and
    zh-TW resources, matching the BCP-47 tags reported by
    i18next-browser-languagedetector.
    
